  "releaseNotes": "Fixed: a press held for the delay but released before the script's timer caught up raised no longpress (with ShortClick, neither a click nor a long press happened). The release now raises it, measured by the events' own timestamps. Patch from https://github.com/john-doherty/long-press-event/pull/57, removed with the upstream release that contains it.",
